Adaptive Stress Monitoring on Wearable Devices for Long-Term Consumer Health

This repository contains preliminary implementation and experiments for wearable stress recognition using physiological signals and self-supervised learning.

## Features
- Wearable physiological signal processing
- Stress classification pipeline
- Edge-oriented experimentation
- Notebook-based reproducibility

## Dataset
- WESAD
- LifeSnaps 

## Running
Open the notebook in Google Colab and install dependencies.

## Note
The repository will be expanded with additional training and evaluation scripts upon publication.

